# Zerg-horde scenarios (docs/zergs.md, section 5): the branch seat against 2-3 coordinated Zergs (zerg@1, the hand-coded
# horde bot; CPU only, zerg.ts is not on the GPU mirror), Jacob Sensei filling the other seats at 4p and 6p. The seat is
# delove-branch@1:range-horde: the range-score branch seat whose rollouts play the Zerg seats with the horde bot
# (src/horde-branch.ts), so its search foresees the gang-up; it reads the same DELOVE_BRANCH_* settings as the cycles. League
# settings (docs/game-settings.md) in two card/capitals variants; the branch seat moves round the table. About 4,000
# games, recorded like any self-play job, to mix into a cycle's training at about 0.3 (the captain decides when).
#
# Once the branch seat (and every filler) is out, the strongest Zerg keeps the table and the others surrender. No Zerg
# sacrifices itself mid-game, so a turtling seat can stall the horde; games are capped at 250 turns (real horde games finish well inside: in a 400-game check the longest finished game was 235 turns
# at 3p and 131 at 6p). A capped game is a draw.
#
#   bash packages/delove/scripts/generate.sh packages/delove/scripts/cycles/horde.jobs runs/horde 1501
#@max-turns 250
h3a   500 delove-branch@1:range-horde,zerg@1,zerg@1 {"autoSetup":true,"balancedBlitz":true,"chooseCapitals":true,"cardValues":"progressive"}
h3b   500 zerg@1,delove-branch@1:range-horde,zerg@1 {"autoSetup":true,"balancedBlitz":true,"chooseCapitals":true,"cardValues":"fixed","capitals":true}
h4a   500 delove-branch@1:range-horde,zerg@1,zerg@1,zerg@1 {"autoSetup":true,"balancedBlitz":true,"chooseCapitals":true,"cardValues":"progressive"}
h4b   500 zerg@1,zerg@1,delove-branch@1:range-horde,zerg@1 {"autoSetup":true,"balancedBlitz":true,"chooseCapitals":true,"cardValues":"fixed","capitals":true}
h4c   500 delove-branch@1:range-horde,zerg@1,zerg@1,jacob-sensei@2 {"autoSetup":true,"balancedBlitz":true,"chooseCapitals":true,"cardValues":"progressive"}
h4d   500 jacob-sensei@2,zerg@1,delove-branch@1:range-horde,zerg@1 {"autoSetup":true,"balancedBlitz":true,"chooseCapitals":true,"cardValues":"fixed","capitals":true}
h6a   500 delove-branch@1:range-horde,zerg@1,zerg@1,zerg@1,jacob-sensei@2,jacob-sensei@2 {"autoSetup":true,"balancedBlitz":true,"chooseCapitals":true,"cardValues":"exponential","blizzards":8}
h6b   500 jacob-sensei@2,zerg@1,jacob-sensei@2,delove-branch@1:range-horde,zerg@1,jacob-sensei@2 {"autoSetup":true,"balancedBlitz":true,"chooseCapitals":true,"cardValues":"progressive","capitals":true,"blizzards":8}
